# ==========================================
# LAPORAN KEUANGAN & KAS OSIS MODULE
# ==========================================

### 1. Lihat Ringkasan Saldo & Daftar Transaksi Kas
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/keuangan
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Catat Transaksi Pemasukan Kas Baru
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/keuangan
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "keterangan": "Dana Kas Sekolah",
    "jenis": "Pemasukan",
    "nominal": 100000,
    "sumber": "Bendahara Sekolah"
}

###

### 3. Catat Transaksi Pengeluaran Kas Baru
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/keuangan
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "keterangan": "Beli Amplop",
    "jenis": "Pengeluaran",
    "nominal": 20000,
    "sumber": "Kas OSIS"
}

###

### 4. Lihat Detail Transaksi Berdasarkan ID
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/keuangan/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Perbarui Transaksi Kas
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/keuangan/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "keterangan": "Beli Amplop dan Stopmap",
    "nominal": 25000
}

###

### 6. Hapus Transaksi Kas
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/keuangan/1
Accept: application/json
